                <pb facs="0267" n="143" xml:id="pg143"/>

                <head>Federation of the Central American Republics<anchor n="22" xml:id="ch5-f1"
                    /></head>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p rendition="#flush">Signing of the Pact of Union, January 19, 1921, by Costa
                        Rica, Guatemala, Honduras, and Salvador; Refusal by Costa Rica to
                        Ratify—Adoption of the Constitution, September 9—Request for Recognition of
                        the Federation by the United States—Revolution in Guatemala,<anchor n="23"
                            xml:id="ch5-f2"/> and Danger of the Federation’s
                        Disruption—Representations by the United States to Guatemala, Honduras, and
                        Salvador, Deprecating an Armed Conflict</p></quote>


































